# AICL Example: Max Difference
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
max adjacent diff

Layer:
Core

Behavior MaxDiff
    Input: array
    Output: result
    Action:
        result = 0
        for i in range(1, len(array)):
            diff = array[i] - array[i - 1]
            if diff < 0:
                diff = -diff
            if diff > result:
                result = diff
        return result
